    <div class="choice-bank" aria-label="Academic listening choices"><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="stress moves from analyze to analysis">stress moves from analyze to analysis</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="a modest attendance difference">a modest attendance difference</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="timing as one possible factor">timing as one possible factor</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="an implication for future design">an implication for future design</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="these participants in this trial">these participants in this trial</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="a universal guarantee">a universal guarantee</button></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>Tutor contrasts <span class="ex">“We ANalyzed”</span> with <span class="ex">“The aNALysis”</span>. The family change shows <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="stress moves from analyze to analysis" data-hint="Listen to the first syllable in the verb and second syllable in the noun." data-fix="Stress moves from ANalyze to aNALysis.">listen</button>.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>Tutor reads: <span class="ex">“The results INdicate / a MODEST attendance difference.”</span> The final nucleus calibrates <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="a modest attendance difference" data-hint="The speaker foregrounds the size and outcome, not a universal claim." data-fix="The line foregrounds a modest attendance difference.">listen</button>.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>Tutor links <span class="ex">factor in</span> and stresses <span class="ex">TIMing</span>. The line presents <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="timing as one possible factor" data-hint="One factor leaves room for additional influences." data-fix="The line presents timing as one possible factor.">listen</button>.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">4</span><span>Tutor reduces <span class="ex">for</span> in <span class="ex">“implications for / future deSIGN.”</span> The message identifies <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="an implication for future design" data-hint="The result may matter for a later practical decision." data-fix="The line identifies an implication for future design.">listen</button>.</span></div>
